# The backend's test suite with -D haxeui_cs_drive (AppDriver, and the driven flows of PumpEvents,
# StartTimer and FileDialogs), which adds TestAppDriver. `tests/headless.hxml` is the suite without
# the define, i.e. what ships; run both. `haxe tests/headless-drive.hxml` from the repo root;
# `-D test=TestAppDriver` for just that case.
tests/headless.hxml
-D haxeui_cs_drive
